From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julian Brown <julian.brown@webpros.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Define HAVE_FT2BUILD_H for bundled libgd

Backport of the config.m4 half of php/php-src#23870 (fixes GH-23862).
Since the libgd 2.4 sync, gdft.c only includes <ft2build.h> when
HAVE_FT2BUILD_H is defined, but config.m4 never defines it. FreeType
< 2.10 (e.g. EL8's 2.9.1) refuses <freetype/freetype.h> without it.
Drop this patch once the upstream fix is in a PHP 8.6 release.
---
 ext/gd/config.m4 | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ext/gd/config.m4 b/ext/gd/config.m4
--- a/ext/gd/config.m4
+++ b/ext/gd/config.m4
@@ -181,6 +181,8 @@
     PHP_EVAL_LIBLINE([$FREETYPE2_LIBS], [GD_SHARED_LIBADD])
     AC_DEFINE([HAVE_LIBFREETYPE], [1],
       [Define to 1 if you have the FreeType library.])
+    AC_DEFINE([HAVE_FT2BUILD_H], [1],
+      [Define to 1 if you have the <ft2build.h> header file.])
     AC_DEFINE([HAVE_GD_FREETYPE], [1],
       [Define to 1 if gd extension has FreeType support.])
   ])
